1
00:00:00,826 --> 00:00:02,616
They need electricity from the dam...

2
00:00:02,786 --> 00:00:06,496
(Penny(to Kevin):)...but at the same time,
they wanna preserve the environment.

3
00:00:07,833 --> 00:00:10,083
(Leonard:)You're kidding me.

4
00:00:13,046 --> 00:00:16,466
(Leonard:)- Uh, can I see you for a sec over here?
- Oh, sure. Just one sec?

5
00:00:16,633 --> 00:00:18,263
(Man:)No problem.

6
00:00:19,010 --> 00:00:20,850
- What's up?
- I know what you're doing.

7
00:00:21,012 --> 00:00:23,052
(Leonard:)- What?
- You're going to talk to that guy...

8
00:00:23,223 --> 00:00:26,473
(Leonard:)- ...because I said we weren't on a date.
- I'm talking to him because he's cute.

9
00:00:26,643 --> 00:00:29,393
- Uh, come on. He's not that cute.
- Yes, he is...

10
00:00:29,563 --> 00:00:32,903
(Penny:)...with his dorky T-shirt
and his little hipster glasses.

11
00:00:39,114 --> 00:00:41,154
(Leonard:)I wear dorky T-shirts and glasses.

12
00:00:41,324 --> 00:00:45,494
(Penny:)Yes, but when you're tall and have great
cheekbones, you're doing it ironically.

13
00:00:48,039 --> 00:00:50,919
(Leonard:)- So, what if I start talking to a girl?
- You should.

14
00:00:51,084 --> 00:00:53,754
- Yeah, heh. I'm serious, I'll do it.
- Good, go.

15
00:00:53,920 --> 00:00:59,020
There's some girls right over there.

